intree.\r\n\r\nTravel times:\r\nRiders using shuttle bus service should budget ample extra travel time. For example, a rider traveling to Downtown Crossing from Braintree should budget at least 50 minutes of travel time in addition to their regular commute.\r\n\r\nShuttle Locations:\r\n\r\nBroadway:\r\nW. Broadway @ Broadway Station\r\n\r\nAndrew:\r\nNorthbound - Dorchester Ave @ Leeds St\r\nSouthbound - Dorchester Ave @ Dexter St\r\n\r\nJFK/UMass:\r\nAll shuttles - Outer Busway\r\n\r\nNorth Quincy:\r\nAll shuttles - North Quincy Station Garage\r\n\r\nView shuttle route and stops:\r\nhttps://platform.remix.com/project/5f8aed43/line/4b559a45-de93-4310-95bf-233f29bfec55?latlng=42.28891,-71.02631,12.72&dir=0&sp.id=e9919513-1793-4c33-8f3d-f75e3fb61cf5\r\n\r\nAdd this to your Calendar:\r\nhttps://calendarlink.com/event/gFHLG", "duration_certainty": "KNOWN", "effect": "SHUTTLE", "header": "Red Line: To allow for switch and rail upgrades, shuttle buses will replace service between Broadway and North Quincy from Nov 20 - 22. Trains will operate between JFK/UMass & Ashmont. Commuter Rail will be fare-free between Braintree and South Station.", "image": "https://cdn.mbta.com/sites/default/files/styles/max_2600x2600/public/media/2026-11/RL%20Broadway-North%20Quincy%20Nov%2020-22%20Diagram.png?itok=dwhDXynw", "image_alternative_text": "Shuttle stops and alternative service options during the Nov. 20-22 Red Line closure", "informed_entity": [{"stop": "70083", "route": "Red", "direction_id": 0, "route_type": 1, "activities": ["BOARD", "EXIT", "RIDE"]}, {"stop": "70095", "route": "Red", "direction_id": 0, "route_type": 1, "activities": ["BOARD", "EXIT", "RIDE"]}, {"stop": "place-andrw", "route": "Red", "direction_id": 0, "route_type": 1, "activities": ["BOARD", "EXIT", "RIDE"]}, {"stop": "place-jfk", "route": "Red", "direction_id": 0, "route_type": 1, "activities": ["BOARD", "EXIT", "RIDE"]}, {"stop": "70084", "route": "Red", "direction_id": 1, "route_type": 1, "activities": ["BOA